message: "If you use CausalBio Lab in research or teaching, please cite the software and the primary studies represented in the selected evidence pack."
title: "CausalBio Lab"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - name: "CausalBio Lab contributors"
abstract: >-
  Local-first research software for provenance-rich biological mechanism graphs,
  competing-hypothesis comparison, curated Petri-net simulation, and explicit
  uncertainty eligibility.
